---
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Legal Notice | einvoiceops</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Legal notice and service provider identification for einvoiceops." />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --navy:   #1a2b3c;
      --accent: #2563eb;
      --text:   #111827;
      --sub:    #374151;
      --muted:  #6b7280;
      --border: #e5e7eb;
      --bg:     #ffffff;
      --sans:   -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      font-family: var(--sans);
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--bg);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 56px 2rem 80px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: var(--navy);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .subtitle {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.07em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 36px 0 10px;
    }
    p, address {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--sub);
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-style: normal;
    }
    p + p { margin-top: 10px; }
    .pending {
      color: #92400e;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .notice {
      background: #eff6ff;
      border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: #1e40af;
      line-height: 1.65;
      margin-top: 40px;
    }
    a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    footer {
      padding: 28px 2rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    footer p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
    footer a { color: var(--accent); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <Nav />

  <main>
    <h1>Legal Notice</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Impressum (DE) &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Mentions L&eacute;gales (FR) &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Palveluntarjoajan tiedot (FI)
    </p>

    <h2>Service Provider</h2>
    <address>
      einvoiceops Oy (in formation)<br />
      Jens Anttila<br />
      Nallenpolku 4f90<br />
      02110 Espoo<br />
      Finland
    </address>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Email: <a href="mailto:jens@einvoiceops.eu">jens@einvoiceops.eu</a><br />
      Phone: <a href="tel:+358400374990">+358 400 374 990</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Business Registration</h2>
    <p>
      Finnish Business ID (Y-tunnus): <span class="pending">pending &mdash; einvoiceops Oy registration in progress</span><br />
      VAT Registration Number: <span class="pending">pending</span>
    </p>

    <h2>Regulatory Basis</h2>
    <p>
      This legal notice is provided pursuant to the Finnish Act on Electronic Communications Services
      (917/2014), the EU e-Commerce Directive (2000/31/EC), German teleservices legislation (DDG),
      and French requirements under the Loi pour la Confiance dans l'&Eacute;conomie
      Num&eacute;rique (LCEN 2004-575).
    </p>

    <h2>Professional Activity</h2>
    <p>
      einvoiceops provides operational readiness support for EU e-invoicing mandates. This service does
      not constitute tax advice, legal advice, or compliance authority opinion.
      See the <a href="/">service description</a> for full scope and applicable disclaimers.
    </p>

    <div class="notice">
      <strong>Note:</strong> einvoiceops Oy is currently in formation under Finnish law. Business
      registration details (Y-tunnus, VAT number, registered address) will be updated on this page
      upon completion. In the interim, Jens Anttila operates as the responsible natural person.
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>einvoiceops &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href="mailto:jens@einvoiceops.eu">jens@einvoiceops.eu</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Finland</p>
    <p>&copy; 2026 einvoiceops &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href="/legal/">Legal Notice</a> &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
